l":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157102","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"雪華","creatorId":"vndb:s19062","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19062","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19062","name":"雪華","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157106","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"心友","creatorId":"vndb:s19063","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19063","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19063","name":"心友","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157107","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"ヅラ","creatorId":"vndb:s19064","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19064","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19064","name":"ヅラ","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157109","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c86613","characterName":"西条 凍時","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c86613"},"originalCharacterName":"西条 凍時","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"In ~Touji Hen~"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The distinguished son of the president of a certain major corporation. Always cool, calm and collected, he's regarded as a competent son and heir with a promising future. Before meeting the protagonist, he was as cold as ice with no interest in anybody. However, he fell for her at first sight and a mad, twisted love for awoken. He gradually becomes madder and madder as his twisted love for her grows deeper."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c86613"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/01f4acdc3526a7abc9ab0de4b57c10084070b95fe9b319962ff88873e4ecd80f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e6fc543db72634a9826b1032cbb2184fcfa84e34dfa0f950f7696c84feae5847.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三楽 章","creatorId":"vndb:s1399","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1399","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1399","name":"牧野 秀紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:81263","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c86617","characterName":"西条 光","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c86617"},"originalCharacterName":"西条 光","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"In ~Yamana Gakuen Hen, Hikaru Hen~"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Saijou Touji's son. He's the president of the student council at the private Yamana Academy. Handsome with excellent grades, he's so popular among fellow students that they call him a \"prince\". He passes off as a calm gentleman but because the protagonist called off her engagement with him, the darkness beneath the surface begins to overflow."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In ~Yamana Gakuen Hen, Kazuma Hen~"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In his own story (Hikaru Hen), he stole Kazuma's lover. He's known Kazuma since they were kids and they were best friends but at this stage, the atmosphere between them is volatile. He's so popular at school that he's called a \"prince\", however, he also has a cold side to him that would go to any length to achieve his goals."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In ~Yamana Gakuen Hen, Yamato Hen~"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The distinguished son of the president of a certain major corporation. He's the president of the student council at the private Yamana Academy. Since he attended the hospital that Yamato's family manages, the two are acquaintances. Yamato's violent nature causes Hikaru to questions the former's resolve."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c86617"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ef/ef0a9b9b9383a4002c63a3f1cdbace70561566b15cc9e7c46367c2954a436d03.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/342653a66a5ffbd6329c7799517537fb2bf1a60e59545121b00477c670825b48.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三楽 章","creatorId":"vndb:s1399","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1399","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1399","name":"牧野 秀紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:81264","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c86618","characterName":"久世 一真","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c86618"},"originalCharacterName":"久世 一真","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"In ~Yamana Gakuen Hen, Hikaru Hen~"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The secretary of the private Yamana Academy's student council. He's been childhood friends with the protagonist since elementary school and with Hikaru since kindergarten. When it comes to sports specifically, his grades are exceptional. He's admired by his peers for his good looks and straightforward personality. He becomes lovers with the protagonist that he's long had feelings for, but..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In ~Yamana Gakuen Hen, Kazuma Hen~"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The heir of the Kuse household; a distinguished household that goes as far back as the Meiji Era. However, he's not up himself about his pedigree and is an amiable person. He's better with sports than with studies and has been taught various martial arts by his father. Kazuma is popular with the female students but since he's too earnest, he's only dated one girl thus far. That said girl was stolen away from him by his childhood friend Saijou Hikaru. From the shock of losing both his childhood friend and the girl he loved, he vowed that he'll be \"single for the rest of my life\". However, in his story (Kazuma Hen), he finds himself in a completely unexpected situation due to Hikaru's machinations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In ~Yamana Gakuen Hen, Yamato Hen~"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The heir of the Kuse household; a distinguished household that goes as far back as the Meiji Era. However, he's not up himself about his pedigree and is an amiable person. He fiercely fought with his childhood friend Saijou Hikaru but in Yamato Hen, they've made up. He worries about the troubled protagonist."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c86618"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8ef363e12b098995a62e74408b7eb2f73eb5571a898404691d81c931cd6d8204.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/62ce3da8bc8dd6becd9a42de3477823868b11f70e0cae52d3162075d38f07bc4.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三重 奏","creatorId":"vndb:s17564","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17564","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17564","name":"花村ゆうき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:81267","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c86619","characterName":"山那 誠","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c86619"},"originalCharacterName":"山那 誠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"In ~Makoto Hen~"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A PE teacher at Yamana Academy, his grandfather is its chairman. A kind and pleasant young man, he's admired and trusted by the students. However, a certain event causes him to become convinced that the protagonist is his \"fated lover\" and Makoto becomes unable to hold back his feelings. His peers and Makoto himself see him as normal but he's somewhat of a broken person."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c86619"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e92826c02b189178f7973ee860bc298928cd0d1217b0f50beceaa4c3f2bf46b0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d77858ed2edb6328b0b44f027e82ebdcfd291b108175f8b283c1ebdeaf43ddb1.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"深川 緑","creatorId":"vndb:s5570","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5570","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5570","name":"北山 恭祐","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:81265","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c86620","characterName":"皇 大和","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c86620"},"originalCharacterName":"皇 大和","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"In ~Yamana Gakuen Hen, Yamato Hen~"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third year student at Yamana Academy. He's acquaintances with Saijou Hikaru since their childhood. The son of a family that owns a major hospital, he's meant to succeed the family business. However, due to disagreements between him and his parents, Yamato has been constantly getting into delinquent conduct. Despite his misconduct, his grades are excellent as his brilliant mind allows him to remember whatever he's observed at least once. Yamato was once apathetic towards anyone but since the protagonist saved him when he got into a fight in a back alley three years ago, she's the only person he's become attached to."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c86620"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37e96f375d24012f7389eb35aee85975bfbb4b60ab114602bd4d56e30a0a11aa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8fe060d4d3a4362dba5d409fa4bbeea91797b50d9dbd0457ba24de8df69df13e.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"八王子 タカオ","creatorId":"vndb:s8196","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8196","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8196","name":"深町 寿成","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:81266","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c86621","characterName":"久世 総司","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c86621"},"originalCharacterName":"久世 総司","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"In ~Yamana Gakuen Hen, Kazuma Hen~"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kazuma's older brother. Souji is is cheerful, extroverted and loves to have fun. He looks brainless but he's actually incredibly intelligent and blessed with excellent observation skills. Since he loves and dotes on Kazuma so much, he sometimes can't help but overly meddle Kazuma's affairs."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c86621"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[{"creditedName":"蒼山 雅宗","creatorId":"vndb:s19759","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19759","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19759","name":"蒼山雅宗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:81268","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[